sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code<br/>(TrainerClient)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as Trainer Controller
    participant Pod as Training Pod<br/>28080/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Sidecar<br/>8234/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: Flow 1: Training Job Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer token (kubeconfig)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch TrainJob
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: TrainJob event
    Controller->>Pod: Schedule training pod
    Pod->>K8sAPI: Status updates<br/>Auth: Projected SA token
    Pod->>HF: Download model/dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (Bearer)
    HF-->>Pod: Model artifacts
    Controller->>Pod: GET / (metrics)<br/>Port 28080, No auth
    Pod-->>Controller: Progression JSON
    Pod->>S3: Upload checkpoints<br/>Auth: AWS credentials (fsspec/s3fs)
    S3-->>Pod: Upload confirmed

    Note over User,S3: Flow 2: Speculative Decoding (DATA_ONLY)

    User->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob CR<br/>(SpeculativeDecodingTrainer)
    Controller->>Pod: Schedule pod with vLLM sidecar
    Pod->>vLLM: Extract hidden states<br/>localhost:8234/TCP, No auth
    vLLM-->>Pod: Hidden state tensors
    Pod->>Pod: Write to PVC<br/>/mnt/kubeflow-checkpoints

    Note over User,MR: Flow 3: Model Registration

    User->>MR: Register model version<br/>Auth: user_token (PEM)
    MR-->>User: Model registered
    User->>S3: Upload model artifact<br/>Auth: Storage credentials
    S3-->>User: Upload confirmed
